<main class="ip-page"><section class="ip-sec"><h1 class="ip-h1">Support the press</h1>
<p class="ip-lede">Inkhorn Press is a nonprofit publisher. Your gift pays contributors and keeps every journal free to read online.</p>
<div class="ip-btns"><a class="ip-btn" href="#/portal/support" data-portal="support">Give to Inkhorn Press</a><a class="ip-btn alt" href="https://www.patreon.com/cw/inkhornreview" rel="noopener">Give monthly on Patreon</a></div>
<p class="ip-note">Give to Inkhorn Press is a one-time gift to the press, paid by card through Stripe. Patreon is a separate service: monthly gifts there go to the Inkhorn Review Patreon page.</p>
<h2 class="ip-h2" style="margin-top:40px">Who publishes what</h2>
<p class="ip-prose">Inkhorn Press publishes White Rabbit and holds the events. <em>Inkhorn Review</em>&rsquo;s Autumn 2026 and Winter 2026 issues are published by Follow the Rabbit LLC, and from Spring 2027 Inkhorn Press publishes the Review.</p>
<p class="ip-note">Questions about a gift? Write <a href="mailto:hello@inkhorn.press">hello@inkhorn.press</a>.</p></section></main>
